&#x1F916; [RECAP: MARVELOUS AT AI+ UNLIMITED FUTURE 2025]

On July 18, representatives from Marvelous was honored to participate in AI+ Unlimited Future 2025 &#x2013; one of Vietnam&#x2019;s leading forums on artificial intelligence and innovation. The event brought together a vibrant community of tech experts, international investors, and pioneering businesses shaping the future with AI. &#x1F680;

&#x1F4A1; With a spirit of learning and connection, Marvelous was especially impressed by the strategic insights and global mindset shared throughout the program. More than just a showcase of trends, the event offered valuable opportunities for us to explore partnerships within a fast-growing innovation ecosystem.

&#x1F331; Marvelous is proud to stand alongside Vietnam&#x2019;s tech community in the journey to strengthen competitiveness, especially for SMEs. We believe that the connections and inspiration gained from the event will serve as a solid foundation for sustainable growth in the AI era.

Our sincere thanks to the organizers for creating such a professional, open, and inspiring platform. &#x1F30F;&#x2728;

