&#x1F3AE; [RECAP MARVELOUS AT VGC 2025]

On July 16, Marvelous had the honor of attending Vietnam Game Connect 2025&#x2014;the largest B2B event dedicated to the mobile gaming industry in Vietnam. It was a valuable opportunity for us to connect, learn, and collaborate with the Vietnamese gaming community and international partners. &#x1F30D;&#x1F91D;

&#x1F4A1; We were especially impressed by the spirit of &#x201C;Meet. Connect. Create.&#x201D; that VGC brought to life&#x2014;turning every conversation into something genuine and meaningful. Marvelous believes that these connections will serve as a solid foundation for future breakthroughs.

We extend our heartfelt thanks to the organizers of VGC for creating such a professional and impactful platform for the local game development community. Marvelous is truly honored to have been part of this exciting journey in such a promising industry.

We look forward to seeing the community again at upcoming events. Let&#x2019;s keep connecting and creating extraordinary things for the Vietnamese game industry! &#x1F680;
