&#x1F539; By 2030, Ho Chi Minh City aims to develop 41&#x2013;44 seaport terminals, 18,000 meters of quay length, and handle up to 253 million tons of cargo, including 12.8 million TEUs (Vietnamnet 2025)&#xA0;
