&#x2705; Opportunities for joint ventures in smart port infrastructure, bonded warehouses, cold chain, and automated handling systems&#xA0;
&#x2705; Multimodal logistics development via integrated road, rail, and inland waterway links&#xA0;
&#x2705; Strong government support with infrastructure incentives and streamlined customs reform&#xA0;
&#x2705; Emerging potential in green port technology and supply chain digitization 

