On March 29, 2025, Nutifood will officially commence construction on a pedestrian bridge connecting Bach Dang Wharf Park to the riverside park in the Thu Thiem New Urban Area, Thu Duc City. With a total investment of VND 996.9 billion, the project is fully funded by Nutifood.&#x1F477;

Inspired by the image of the nipa palm - symbolizing resilience and vitality in the Mekong Delta - the bridge is a heartfelt gift from Nutifood to customers who have supported the company throughout its 25-year journey. &#x1F334;

The pedestrian bridge over the Saigon River will not only become an architectural highlight of Ho Chi Minh City but also boost tourism and enhance connectivity between the city center and the Thu Thiem New Urban Area.&#x1F3D9;&#xFE0F;

