&#x1F1FB;&#x1F1F3; The VinFuture Foundation proudly celebrates the 80th anniversary of Vietnam&#x2019;s National Day (September 2, 1945 &#x2013; September 2, 2025), honoring the nation&#x2019;s remarkable journey of independence, freedom, and happiness. &#x2728;
&#xA0;
This period marks&#xA0;a particularly proud moment for us as VinFuture participates in Vietnam&#x2019;s Exhibition of 80 Years of National Achievements, a landmark event celebrating the&#xA0;country&#x2019;s resilience, innovation, and development. At this grand gathering, the Foundation has the honor of presenting the VinFuture Prize, the first international science and technology prize initiated by Vietnamese people.
&#xA0;
The showcase also highlights VinFuture&#x2019;s five-year journey, with over 6,000 nominations from more than 14,700 partners across 90 countries and nearly 20,000 scientists and young talents engaged through 80 global events. Together, these milestones reflect Vietnam&#x2019;s rising influence in the international scientific community.
&#xA0;
Carrying forward this spirit, the VinFuture Foundation reaffirms its mission to recognize and promote scientific breakthroughs that advance humanity&#x2014;fostering progress, inclusivity, and a brighter future for generations to come.

