&#x1F9CA; What Products Require Reefer Containers for Export?&#xA0;
As Vietnam&#x2019;s export volume of perishable and temperature-sensitive goods continues to grow, Reefer Containers (refrigerated containers) have become essential for ensuring product integrity throughout long-distance journeys. At Galaxy Express, we specialize in cold chain logistics that meet the highest international standards.&#xA0;
Below are 8 key product groups commonly shipped in reefer containers from Vietnam: 

1. Seafood: Frozen or fresh fish, shrimp, squid, crab, and other marine products requiring low temperatures to preserve quality.&#xA0;
2. Fresh Fruits: Durian, mango, dragon fruit, jackfruit, star apple, rambutan, and other tropical fruits destined for distant markets like the EU, North America, Japan, and South Korea.&#xA0;
3. Fresh Vegetables &amp; Roots: Leafy greens, tomatoes, carrots, potatoes, onions, and garlic that require controlled cooling to stay fresh.&#xA0;
4. Frozen Meats: Beef, pork, and poultry products intended for export or domestic distribution.&#xA0;
5. Dairy &amp; Eggs: Milk, cheese, yogurt, chicken and duck eggs &#x2013; all of which demand strict cold storage compliance.&#xA0;
6. Pharmaceuticals &amp; Medicines: Vaccines, specialty drugs, and medical products that require cold environments to remain effective.&#xA0;
7. Fresh Flowers &amp; Sensitive Agricultural Goods: Cut flowers, seedlings, and produce needing both humidity and temperature control.&#xA0;
8. Chilled Beverages: Premium wines, craft beer, and high-quality juice products that need stable temperatures to maintain taste and safety. 

&#x2705; Why Choose Reefer Containers? 

Ensure consistent cold chain temperature throughout transit.&#xA0;
Maintain product freshness and prevent microbial spoilage.&#xA0;
Comply with food safety and phytosanitary standards of import markets. 

&#x1F30D; At Galaxy Express, we help exporters navigate the complexity of temperature-controlled logistics &#x2013; ensuring that quality never gets lost in transit. 

&#x1F4E9; Contact our cold chain logistics experts for the right reefer strategy tailored to your product. 

