&#x1F539; Which Products Are Best Suited for General Purpose Containers in Export?&#xA0;
As one of the most commonly used container types in global trade, the General Purpose (GP) Container is a reliable, weather-tight solution for a wide range of dry cargo. At Galaxy Express, we support exporters across Vietnam by optimizing GP container usage to ensure efficiency and safety.&#xA0;
Here are 8 key product categories frequently shipped in GP containers from Vietnam: 

Textiles &amp; Apparel: garments, fabric rolls, towels, jeans, undergarments.&#xA0;
Footwear &amp; Fashion Accessories: shoes, sandals, bags, backpacks, wallets.&#xA0;
Electronics &amp; Components: consumer electronics, phone accessories, home devices.&#xA0;
Consumer &amp; Household Goods: plasticware, kitchen tools, toys, interior d&#xE9;cor.&#xA0;
Machinery &amp; Mechanical Equipment: mid-sized industrial/farm machinery, spare parts.&#xA0;
Construction Materials: cement, ceramic tiles, steel coils, decorative stone.&#xA0;
Processed Agricultural Products: rice, coffee, cashew, pepper, tea, dried foods.&#xA0;
Wood Products &amp; Handicrafts: furniture, crafted wooden items, treated timber. 

&#x2705; Key considerations: 

Goods must be securely packaged to prevent moisture and damage.&#xA0;
Not recommended for temperature-sensitive or perishable goods.&#xA0;
Adhering to container weight &amp; space regulations optimizes cost-efficiency. 

