&#x1F1F2;&#x1F1FE;&#x2728; Celebrating Merdeka with the <a class="link" href="https://vn.linkedin.com/company/mbc-hcm?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Malaysia Business Chamber Vietnam - MBC</a> was truly a night to remember!

