I am proud to be Malaysian, and even prouder to see the strong support from our business community and partners in Vietnam. A special thank you to <a class="link" href="https://vn.linkedin.com/company/pwc-vietnam?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>PwC Vietnam</a> for being one of our Silver Sponsors and supporting this meaningful celebration. &#x1F64F;

