NEOM is a next-generation beauty and lifestyle brand founded by Malaysians, with its first flagship in Ho Chi Minh City. More than a store, it fuses cosmetics, skincare, personal care, co-working, and a caf&#xE9; into one vibrant hub designed for the new generation. With a futuristic and tech-driven spirit, NEOM delivers safe, effective, and inspiring products that make premium self-care accessible without the premium price. Our mission goes beyond beauty, we aim to empower confidence, spread positivity, and redefine lifestyle experiences across Asia&apos;s most dynamic cities.

description:
Flipside Vietnam | 3 followers on LinkedIn. Our aim is to showcase this intrepid and uniquely picturesque area to all types of adventure based travellers. | Flipside Adventures Vietnam (previously Flipside Backpackers Hostels) are Kiwi owned and operated.
Post Covid 19 we have been forced to close all locations in Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh Cities. during this time we have been building a boutique lodge in Ha Giang city.
Our famous True North Tour of the Ha Giang loop has not stopped running but instead we have used the downtime to capitalize on perfecting a tour which was already referred to by many as &quot;the best experience I had in Vietnam!&quot;

