&#x201C;When a hand is extended, an entire heart is touched&#x2026;&#x201D;

In recent days, Western Nghe An has been devastated by storms and floods. Tropical Storm No. 3 swept away not only soil, crops, and houses but also left behind vacant stares and weary sighs amidst wind and rain.

On July 29, 2025, the Department of External Security, in collaboration with Vilaconic Joint Stock Company and many other generous organizations and individuals, organized a meaningful charity program &#x2013; bringing not only essential supplies but also compassion, solidarity, and humanity.

&#x1F381; The aid packages included food essentials such as rice, cooking oil, and instant noodles, delivered directly to each household in need.

Without fanfare or flowery words, the program served as a heartfelt bridge connecting people &#x2013; so that &quot;those far away feel the warmth of love,&quot; and &quot;those nearby know they are not alone.&quot;

&#x1F91D; Vilaconic firmly believes: The greatest value lies not in abundance, but in the power of sharing.

We extend our deepest gratitude to all those who joined hands in this effort. May Western Nghe An soon recover &#x2013; stronger and more resilient after the storm. &#x2764;&#xFE0F;

